\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Post 2:\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 13 lessons I\'92ve learnt from starting a business at 28, sitting reflecting aged 33:
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 You have to choose to enjoy the ride. The stress and imposter feelings will never go away. It\'92s up to you to find the good stuff.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Work with people who give you energy. If their attitude is right and your communication is effective, you\'92ll fly together.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 It\'92s a marathon not a sprint. The aim is not to retire at 34 -\'a0
\f1\fs24 \

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 what would I do then? I can take the pressure off.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Obsess over what your customer wants from you, not what you want to build.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Say yes to everything at the beginning. Then, when you have traction, say no - a lot.
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Your personal brand is your super power. Prioritise from day 1 so that when you need it, you\'92ve got leverage.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Know your numbers. Understand your financial performance inside out, always.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Accept offers to help with open arms. People LOVE helping. Never fail to say thank you. Do not leave debts unpaid.
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Cash really is king. Make sure you\'92re get paid for everything and don\'92t assume you\'92ll be paid on time.
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Content really is queen. This means your messaging needs to be clear and simple. It doesn\'92t mean you need to over-invest.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Don\'92t skip sleep. It\'92ll come back and bite you in the ass.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Be excellent at staying in touch. Your network is everything so get organised really early.\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Finally\'85\'a0
\f1\fs24 \
\

\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 Never forget your decision is a privilege. You could have another job. You could choose to stop at any point. Do not feel sorry for yourself.
\f1\fs24 \
\

